---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../config/site';
---
<PageLayout legal title="Advertising and Affiliate Disclosure" description={`How ${SITE_NAME} is funded, how ads are marked and kept separate from results, and our policy on affiliate links and sponsorship.`} path="/advertising-disclosure/">
  <p>{SITE_NAME} is free to use. We may earn money from advertising, and this page explains how that works so you can tell content from ads.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>The Site may display ads served by Google AdSense. Ads appear in labelled boxes marked "Advertisement" and are separate from calculator results, worked examples and explanations. Advertisers do not pay for, review or change any calculation, figure or article. Ads only load if you accept advertising cookies; see the <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>No endorsement</h2>
  <p>An ad on the Site is not a recommendation or endorsement by us of the advertiser, its products or any financial product. We do not control which ads Google shows, and ads may be based on your browsing if you consented to personalised advertising. If you see an ad that looks misleading, tell us using the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> and we will report it to the ad provider.</p>

  <h2>Affiliate links and sponsored content</h2>
  <p>At the time of writing the Site has no affiliate links and no sponsored articles. If we add any, we will say so on the page where they appear, close to the link or text and in plain words, such as "we may earn a commission if you use this link". Paid or affiliate relationships will not change how a calculator computes a result.</p>

  <h2>Financial products</h2>
  <p>We do not sell loans, insurance, investments or tax services, and we are not paid based on which calculator result you see. Results are estimates only and are not advice; see the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</p>

  <h2>Rules we follow</h2>
  <p>We aim to follow applicable advertising rules, including the US Federal Trade Commission's guidance on endorsements and online advertising disclosures (16 CFR Part 255), the Advertising Standards Council of India's guidelines and the Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules in India, as they apply to a site of this kind. This page is a statement of our practice, not a legal opinion.</p>
</PageLayout>
